  "reweight_source": {
    "method": "Selection-count-weighted empirical CER across the 29 real bigP3BCI Studies F/L/N participants (2,537 eligible Test-phase selections, 425 EDF files), re-derived directly via idrift.data.materialize_confusion.collect_eligible_rows -- NOT the simulated exposure realized_cer.",
